  "prefLabel": "He-E 806.32 Methodology for Determining the Per Diem Rate for New NFs, When Reconstruction Occurs, and When a Change in Ownership Occurs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 806.32 Methodology for Determining the Per Diem Rate for New NFs, When Reconstruction Occurs, and When a Change in Ownership Occurs. The initial prospective per diem rate for new facilities, including existing facilities under new ownership shall be calculated at the average per diem rate for NH facilities until a full year audited cost report is available for inclusion in the per diem rate setting process.\n\nSource. #8547, eff 1-24-06 (formerly He-W 593.04); ss by #10474, 1-24-14; ss by #14020, eff 7-10-24; ss by #14149, eff 12-12-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-e800.html"
